# London Roots Management System

## Project Description
The London Roots Management System is a database-driven project developed for a sustainable retail business.

The system focuses on managing business information and supporting daily operations.

## Technologies
- Python
- SQLite
- Database Management

## Main Features
- Employee management
- Customer management
- Product management
- Sales management
- Database operations (CRUD)

## Purpose
This project demonstrates my knowledge of database management, software development and data organisation.
